Standing close to nine feet tall and dressed in a stained white tee studded with yellowish metal arm-bands, flare gauges, and gem-laced braids through both beard and tail, [[Smiler]] cuts the figure of a centaur who has long abandoned any pretence of respectability — which suits his dual role as proprietor and fence of [[Undertable|the Undertable]] pawn shop. [[Johnny]] knows him well enough from past dealings to keep one hand on his purse.
